sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SO as Sell Offer Subsystem
    participant BAL as Balance Subsystem

    Note over SO,BAL: Every state change is also emitted as an audit event to the Audit subsystem, asynchronously and off the trade path

    Note over SO,BAL: PHASE 1 - PRE-PAYMENT (after the lock)
    SO->>BAL: Payment requested (offer id, buyer, seller, price, fee) - sync
    BAL->>BAL: Check buyer eligible balance
    alt Not enough money
        BAL-->>SO: Rejected INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE
    else Enough money
        BAL->>BAL: Create REQUESTED records with expiration: PaymentRequest(offer id, buyer, seller, price, fee), buyer debit (price + margin), seller credit (supplier price), platform fee credit (margin)
        BAL-->>SO: Accepted
    end
    Note over SO,BAL: PHASE 2 - VALIDATION IN SELL OFFER

    Note over SO,BAL: PHASE 3 - PAYMENT
    SO->>SO: Insert the payment (timeout shorter than the record expiration)
    SO-)BAL: Payment transaction (async, outbox and CDC)
    alt All records REQUESTED and not expired
        BAL->>BAL: In ONE transaction: records REQUESTED to EXECUTED and the exchange record inserted
        BAL-)SO: ExchangeCompleted(offer id) (async, CDC)
    else Records expired or REJECTED
        BAL-)SO: PaymentRejected (async, CDC)
    end

    Note over SO,BAL: No payment transaction arrives before the records expire: nothing to update. The expired records are ignored and the buyer funds are free again